# ticks 28630
# t0 22440
# mctas mobfarm queue-loop-run <design> --cycles 60 --seed 1 --release-for 34 --advance-at 38 --advance-every 20 --pulse 10
# start: Run::start(spec, RunOpts { ai: true, ..steady(seed, ticks, Random) }); settle_tick until false; spawn the design's entity lines in order (e0 .. e20, each a minecart with its villager e<N>.p0); t0 = the time right after that spawn; act t applied when the time is t0 + t, before the next tick
# build: built in order instead: Run::start with the design's blocks and block entities removed (no settle), then each `act t set x y z <state>` a placement with the game's updates (flags 3) and each `act t nbt x y z <snbt>` a container's fill, in the build order, 20 gt between placements; every time here counts from the build's start (time 0), not from t0
